> Playing an 'n' or 'l' creature would be *really* different, but
> probably too easy. Ideas?

It occurs to me that if the race were to have intrinsic teleportitis,
but not teleport control, it would make the game quite challenging. I
worry, though, that the balance would simply be too wildly out of
control. The game is almost unplayable until you get TC, and then it
becomes very, very easy.

Playing a nymph would be nice (can you restrict the gender of races?)
but the ability to steal items may be too powerful. A leprechaun would
be naturally able to steal (like a rogue), but whether you would
automatically teleport after getting the money may be abusable.



